&lt;p&gt;BeyondTrust is a place where you can bring your purpose to life through the work that you do, creating a safer world through our cybersecurity SaaS portfolio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our culture of flexibility, trust, and continual learning means you will be recognized for your growth, and for the impact you make on our success. You will be surrounded by people who challenge, support, and inspire you to be the best version of yourself.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;The Role&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Sr DevOps Engineer in our Software Engineering department, you will collaborate with our Engineering and Technical Support teams. We are looking for a passionate and motivated Senior Dev Ops Engineer who enjoys the challenge of solving tough problems in a dynamic environment. This individual thrives at problem solving, getting to the root cause within software or the environment in which it runs, and is motivated by doing what is right for our products and our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly with the engineering team, quality assurance, and operations professionals to determine requirements and implement solutions to maintain the operations of cloud products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continually maintain detailed tracking of work activities, risk, and future work for planning purposes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You live and breathe product reliability, uptime, and pride yourself on proactively anticipating issues, creating solutions, and solving problems before they are reported by the customer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;What You’ll Bring&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ Years’ experience in the design and maintenance of Continuous Integration (CI) and Continuous Deployment (CD) systems to support critical cloud services in Microsoft Azure or other cloud services provider.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience in the maintenance of cloud services and deployments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing and deploying solutions using Azure AZDO build pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using Terraform to deploy solutions in Microsoft Azure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding critical thinking and problem-solving skills, willing and eager to dig into existing work and make improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PowerShell and other Scripting languages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of Git, Ansible, Terraform, Packer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Nice To Have&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using Packer for creating operating system images for multiple platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with github action build and deployment pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Security Knowledge:&amp;nbsp; This is what we do.&amp;nbsp; You may not know everything related to security, but you know what security customers want, and how to make sure they get it. You have a strong desire to learn as much as possible about network security.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agile team experience: Working as a team in scrums, sprints &amp;amp; retrospectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Who You Are&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are an engineer that takes ownership of task and drives them until completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You love to find problems in other people’s code, and fix them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have unwavering personal integrity and work ethic.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are flexible! You are a team player and excel individually as the situation dictates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You ask, “how we can, not why we can’t”.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are passionate, optimistic, and energetic.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have an insatiable thirst for knowledge and improvement and the desire to grow in your role and with the company!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You always work for the best interest of the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are proactive; a tenacious self-starter to the core.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You graciously give and receive feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Better Together&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Diversity. Inclusion. They’re more than just words for us. They are the guiding values of how we build our teams, cultivate leaders, and create a culture where people feel connected.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We take care of our employees so they can take care of our customers. Customers who&amp;nbsp;come from all walks of life just like us. We hire incredible people from diverse backgrounds because when we are different together, we are stronger together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;About Us&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BeyondTrust is the global identity security leader protecting Paths to Privilege™. Our identity-centric approach goes beyond securing privileges and access, empowering organizations with the most effective solution to manage the entire identity attack surface and neutralize threats, whether from external attacks or insiders.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;BeyondTrust is leading the charge in transforming identity security to prevent breaches and limit the blast radius of attacks, while creating a superior customer experience and operational efficiencies. We are trusted by 20,000 customers, including 75 of the Fortune 100, and our global ecosystem of partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Learn more at &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.beyondtrust.com/&quot;&gt;www.beyondtrust.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
